00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:27.450
What are the new things that
everybody should know about?

00:06:27.450 --> 00:06:30.380
DOUG STEVENSON: Well, there's
a bunch of new things.

00:06:30.380 --> 00:06:32.270
So like Abe said, we
have Realtime Database,

00:06:32.270 --> 00:06:33.770
which is still the
Realtime Database

00:06:33.770 --> 00:06:36.000
that you know and love.

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:37.659
There are 15 total components.

00:06:37.659 --> 00:06:38.700
FRANCESC CAMPOY: Not bad.

00:06:38.700 --> 00:06:41.105
DOUG STEVENSON: 13 of
which were core Firebase

00:06:41.105 --> 00:06:43.260
and two which we're
calling integrations, which

00:06:43.260 --> 00:06:45.487
are like standalone products,
which just work well

00:06:45.487 --> 00:06:46.070
with Firebase.

00:06:46.070 --> 00:06:49.296
So I'm going to try to remember
as many of them as I can.

00:06:49.296 --> 00:06:51.420
FRANCESC CAMPOY: I actually
have the list of the 15

00:06:51.420 --> 00:06:53.500
components in front of
me, and you don't see it,

00:06:53.500 --> 00:06:54.740
so please go for it.

00:06:54.740 --> 00:06:55.500
DOUG STEVENSON: This is a quiz.

00:06:55.500 --> 00:06:56.000
All right.

00:06:56.000 --> 00:06:56.711
So let's see.

00:06:56.711 --> 00:06:57.210
We have--

00:06:57.210 --> 00:06:58.932
MARK MANDEL: Don't get
anything wrong now.

00:06:58.932 --> 00:06:59.690
DOUG STEVENSON: Let's see.

00:06:59.690 --> 00:07:01.040
We have Realtime Database.

00:07:01.040 --> 00:07:02.570
We have Storage.

00:07:02.570 --> 00:07:04.110
We have Hosting.

00:07:04.110 --> 00:07:07.880
We have Authentication,
Remote Config.

00:07:07.880 --> 00:07:14.345
There's Test Lab for Android,
Crash Reporting, Dynamic Links.

00:07:14.345 --> 00:07:15.780
Oh, I'm breaking down here.

00:07:18.510 --> 00:07:19.687
App Indexing.

00:07:19.687 --> 00:07:20.770
ABE HASKINS: App Indexing.

00:07:20.770 --> 00:07:21.710
DOUG STEVENSON: Invites.

00:07:21.710 --> 00:07:22.585
MARK MANDEL: Invites.

00:07:24.165 --> 00:07:25.790
DOUG STEVENSON: OK,
I'm going to have--

00:07:25.790 --> 00:07:26.873
ABE HASKINS: And the rest.

00:07:28.645 --> 00:07:29.962
FRANCESC CAMPOY: Rest stuff?

00:07:29.962 --> 00:07:31.420
I'm going to help
